.SH "نام (NAME)"
timew-tags \- display a list of tags
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
\fBtimew tags\fP [\fI<range>\fP]
.fi
.br
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
Displays all the tags that have been used by default.
When a filter is specified, shows only the tags that were used during that time.
.SH "پیکربندی (CONFIGURATION)"
.sp
\fBtags.\fP\fI<tag>\fP\fB.color\fP
.RS 4
Assigns a specific foreground and background color to a tag.
Examples of valid colors include \*(Aqwhite\*(Aq, \*(Aqgray8\*(Aq, \*(Aqblack on yellow\*(Aq, and \*(Aqrgb345\*(Aq.
.RE